{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065379/block/singleImage/3276188/df/1605708994_0s.jpg?updatedAt=1795495601\"/><figcaption>大眾金融控股股價飆升逾七成。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>大眾金融控股（626）私有化議案在周一（23日）獲法院會議及股東特別大會通過。股價飆升逾七成，暫時最多升78.01%，高見2.51元，半日報2.49元，升76.6%，成交4,370萬元。 大眾銀行以協議安排方式提出將公司私有化，每股私有化作價2.5元，涉及7.35億元。該公司宣布，待私有化計劃生效後，預計將於12月9日下午4時起撤銷股份上市地位。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T05:24:03.835735+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T03:50:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T08:17:13.599540+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T05:17:23.215193+00:00","content_hash":"55b9fdf753af2352bfd5b222162f0d1f5c69e404bb4216ca1bf03849cfcafee5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T05:24:03.835735+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}